{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32601","headline":"晚春宿僧院 · 刘沧","name":"晚春宿僧院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧寺春风正落花，淹留数宿惠休家。\n碧空云尽磬声远，清夜月高窗影斜。\n白日闲吟爲道侣，青山遥指是生涯。\n微微一点寒灯在，乡梦不成闻曙鵶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}